WEBVTT

00:33.742 --> 00:34.785
Getsuga...

00:35.077 --> 00:38.872
There is nothing left
to say to you all.

00:49.174 --> 00:53.053
THE CALAMITY

00:54.888 --> 00:57.431
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

00:57.432 --> 01:01.852
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

01:01.853 --> 01:04.314
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

01:04.398 --> 01:07.150
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

01:08.318 --> 01:10.069
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

01:10.070 --> 01:11.320
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

01:11.321 --> 01:13.072
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

01:13.073 --> 01:15.241
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

01:15.242 --> 01:16.742
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

01:16.743 --> 01:18.661
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

01:18.662 --> 01:21.163
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

01:21.164 --> 01:25.460
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

01:25.544 --> 01:29.630
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

01:29.631 --> 01:32.134
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

01:32.217 --> 01:36.929
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

01:36.930 --> 01:39.974
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

01:39.975 --> 01:43.644
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

01:43.645 --> 01:46.480
<i>At the moment, I'm connecting
numerous lights</i>

01:46.481 --> 01:50.193
<i>to form a constellation that paves
tomorrow</i>

01:50.652 --> 01:54.656
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

01:54.740 --> 01:58.076
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

01:58.160 --> 02:03.332
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

02:03.498 --> 02:08.210
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

02:08.211 --> 02:14.509
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

02:14.635 --> 02:16.595
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

02:26.188 --> 02:29.149
Whatever happens isn't going
to surprise me.

02:32.486 --> 02:33.487
Are you still with us?

02:33.779 --> 02:35.322
- I'm okay!
- Of course!

02:35.489 --> 02:36.782
- We protect humans—!
- In front!

02:42.871 --> 02:44.331
Lieutenant Okikiba!

02:46.625 --> 02:47.501
We will protect,

02:47.793 --> 02:49.127
and we will
make it back alive!

02:49.461 --> 02:50.629
Without fail!

02:51.672 --> 02:52.631
Yes!

03:10.482 --> 03:11.942
This isn't looking good...

03:12.484 --> 03:14.486
He's just one guy,

03:14.861 --> 03:17.781
but it feels like we're the ones
being completely outnumbered.

03:20.242 --> 03:22.744
We're gonna die...

03:23.745 --> 03:25.414
before the world ends!

03:33.130 --> 03:34.881
I can't stand that bastard!

04:07.497 --> 04:09.166
Damn it! I can't get close!

04:11.668 --> 04:13.003
What's so funny?

04:13.503 --> 04:14.337
Nothing...

04:15.088 --> 04:17.007
It just brought back an old memory.

04:17.549 --> 04:18.425
Huh?

04:18.675 --> 04:20.844
More importantly,
I've come up with a plan.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.680
Hit me with Getsuga
with everything you've got.

04:24.931 --> 04:27.142
I'll create a path to Yhwach.

04:29.019 --> 04:31.062
Okay, got it!

04:37.027 --> 04:37.986
Getsuga...

04:38.820 --> 04:41.907
...tensho!!

04:46.828 --> 04:47.704
Go!

04:54.669 --> 04:56.254
Completely outnumbered, huh?

04:56.922 --> 04:58.965
That's no reason to back down.

04:59.800 --> 05:02.511
We're the Thirteen
Court Guard Squads!

05:04.971 --> 05:07.182
Sending the Stealth Force
as the vanguard...

05:07.599 --> 05:10.268
We can hardly blame future
generations if they laugh at us.

05:11.478 --> 05:12.437
Shunko!

05:28.161 --> 05:29.079
Cascada.

05:39.005 --> 05:40.006
Shukei...

05:40.799 --> 05:41.842
Hakuteiken.

05:48.723 --> 05:50.517
Go to hell!!!

06:05.448 --> 06:06.616
You can't reach me.

06:11.121 --> 06:12.497
How fragile...

06:12.914 --> 06:14.249
Go die a noble death.

06:18.461 --> 06:19.754
Do you feel it?

06:21.548 --> 06:24.134
That pain is life.

06:28.305 --> 06:30.223
And it is also death.

06:37.647 --> 06:38.940
Everything...

06:39.774 --> 06:40.942
falls before me.

06:48.199 --> 06:52.954
Everything converges on
a future over which I preside.

06:54.372 --> 06:55.248
Ishida!

06:55.332 --> 06:56.333
Ichigo...

06:56.583 --> 06:58.585
All that you have left...

07:00.337 --> 07:02.005
is fear.

07:08.970 --> 07:09.971
Good grief...

07:27.739 --> 07:28.615
Shino!

08:03.316 --> 08:04.651
The time is upon us...

08:05.652 --> 08:08.279
With my power,
the skies of the Three Worlds

08:08.363 --> 08:09.989
will be covered completely.

08:10.782 --> 08:12.742
The world, in its entirety...

08:13.827 --> 08:15.120
will return to nothing.

08:17.122 --> 08:18.832
We take the first step...

08:20.083 --> 08:21.751
from which there will be
no return...

08:22.711 --> 08:24.671
into a sea of blood...

08:26.214 --> 08:28.675
spanning the entire world.

08:43.273 --> 08:43.772
74 PERCENT
WARNING

08:43.773 --> 08:45.399
74 PERCENT
WARNING
If the skies of all Three Worlds...

08:45.400 --> 08:45.775
74 PERCENT
WARNING

08:46.234 --> 08:47.861
are swallowed by the dark power,

08:48.820 --> 08:51.573
the world... will be wiped out...

08:52.282 --> 08:53.366
Think!

08:54.034 --> 08:56.411
What would the captain and
Kisuke Urahara do?

08:57.037 --> 08:58.371
What can we do?

08:58.580 --> 08:59.873
76 PERCENT
77 PERCENT

09:07.547 --> 09:10.216
I swear... to protect...

09:10.383 --> 09:11.676
even if I die!

09:17.432 --> 09:19.309
Spoken like a true Soul Reaper.

09:20.226 --> 09:21.144
Yes, Sir!

09:22.729 --> 09:25.482
We can't let them outshine us now,
can we?

09:29.569 --> 09:30.695
Of course!

09:31.446 --> 09:32.363
Now then...

09:33.573 --> 09:34.574
Shall we...

09:35.158 --> 09:36.159
get going?

09:43.041 --> 09:45.043
You're awfully quiet...

09:45.752 --> 09:46.628
Ishida.

09:47.504 --> 09:50.340
Says the guy who's got
no strength left in his voice.

09:51.591 --> 09:52.759
Oh, is that so?

09:55.345 --> 09:57.722
So then...
What do we do?

10:00.308 --> 10:04.229
At this rate, the world looks like
it's really going to end.

10:06.981 --> 10:09.567
Never thought I'd hear you whine...

10:10.318 --> 10:12.654
That makes it sound more like
it's the end of the world.

10:16.991 --> 10:18.201
Listen, Kurosaki...

10:19.577 --> 10:20.495
What is that?

10:20.995 --> 10:21.871
It's my...

10:24.415 --> 10:26.501
It's our last hope.

10:27.877 --> 10:29.754
If I can shoot this arrowhead
into Yhwach,

10:30.213 --> 10:34.425
it should render him completely
powerless for a moment.

10:34.926 --> 10:36.803
If you had that,
you should have used it—!

10:36.886 --> 10:39.139
It's not just a matter
of it hitting him.

10:39.514 --> 10:41.057
It needs to mix with his blood,

10:41.182 --> 10:43.101
- so it has to pierce his heart.
- Okay, I got it!

10:43.560 --> 10:45.728
What do you need me to do?

10:50.692 --> 10:53.486
Create an opening in Yhwach's
defenses one more time.

10:55.363 --> 10:56.281
Got it!

11:09.210 --> 11:10.670
Ransotengai.

11:11.129 --> 11:12.046
What are you—?

11:14.340 --> 11:15.258
Let's do this!

11:22.682 --> 11:24.058
Ichigo is fighting.

11:24.559 --> 11:24.975
91 PERCENT

11:24.976 --> 11:26.268
91 PERCENT
They're all still fighting!

11:26.269 --> 11:26.727
92 PERCENT
They're all still fighting!

11:26.728 --> 11:27.269
92 PERCENT

11:27.270 --> 11:27.978
93 PERCENT

11:27.979 --> 11:31.440
93 PERCENT
Despair can't be measured
in percentages.

11:31.441 --> 11:31.691
93 PERCENT

11:32.108 --> 11:34.527
Fighting to the bitter end
feels better.

11:34.944 --> 11:38.156
I'd like to shove a Hollow
down that bastard's throat!

11:40.533 --> 11:40.991
WARNING

11:40.992 --> 11:41.533
WARNING
Then let's serve 'em up...

11:41.534 --> 11:42.660
Then let's serve 'em up...

11:43.536 --> 11:44.454
...a Hollow!

11:56.841 --> 11:57.759
What's the matter?

11:58.676 --> 11:59.928
Did you die already?

12:08.394 --> 12:10.063
Who are you talking to?

12:10.647 --> 12:13.149
Then let's bury that bastard.

12:13.483 --> 12:16.569
And then, you're next!

12:21.866 --> 12:24.494
Go! Lady Halibel!

12:27.080 --> 12:29.165
The sky's...

12:29.374 --> 12:31.042
closing!

12:32.001 --> 12:32.919
It really does...

12:33.461 --> 12:35.797
...feel like the
end of the world.

12:36.297 --> 12:37.298
Yes...

12:37.799 --> 12:39.050
It's happening so fast.

12:41.177 --> 12:45.014
Kurosaki is fighting
to save the world.

12:46.182 --> 12:50.353
Then let's protect the place
where Kurosaki will come back to!

12:53.356 --> 12:54.315
You're right.

12:55.316 --> 12:58.027
Let's use all our powers
to do everything we can!

13:19.590 --> 13:20.508
Hey...

13:21.217 --> 13:22.260
The sky is...

13:23.094 --> 13:24.137
Seriously...

13:24.929 --> 13:28.641
The things you try to protect
are always too damn huge.

13:49.078 --> 13:50.663
It's no use!
We won't make it in time!

13:50.955 --> 13:52.123
96 PERCENT
97 PERCENT

13:54.333 --> 13:55.251
The sky's...

13:55.668 --> 13:57.003
getting swallowed up by darkness!

13:58.129 --> 14:01.841
Then let me take on
that huge thing as well!

14:04.761 --> 14:08.181
Let me carry you!!

14:08.306 --> 14:09.140
97 PERCENT
98 PERCENT

14:09.182 --> 14:11.893
Boost Nel up there too!

14:12.101 --> 14:12.935
What?!

14:13.269 --> 14:14.771
Boost Nel up to the sky!

14:15.605 --> 14:16.647
Sounds good!

14:24.739 --> 14:25.615
98 PERCENT
99 PERCENT

14:25.782 --> 14:26.866
It's over!

14:27.408 --> 14:28.451
Seppa!

14:28.951 --> 14:31.245
Turn to Sand!

14:38.544 --> 14:40.838
Bring it on!

14:41.756 --> 14:42.673
Iba!

14:45.384 --> 14:46.302
Okay!

14:46.427 --> 14:49.805
100 PERCENT
99 PERCENT

14:49.806 --> 14:50.722
100 PERCENT
99 PERCENT
It stopped...

14:50.723 --> 14:51.431
100 PERCENT
99 PERCENT

14:51.432 --> 14:52.390
100 PERCENT
99 PERCENT
Why?

14:52.391 --> 14:52.558
100 PERCENT
99 PERCENT

14:52.809 --> 14:53.810
Who cares why?!

14:54.268 --> 14:55.937
Report our rate of advance!

14:56.270 --> 14:57.146
Y-Yes, sir!

14:57.480 --> 15:00.149
576 Hollows are moving this way.

15:00.399 --> 15:03.236
Their numbers are greatly depleted
after being met by thing in black.

15:03.611 --> 15:05.279
At this rate,
by the time they get here...

15:05.404 --> 15:07.073
I don't need predictions
or guesses!

15:07.156 --> 15:09.617
Just keep throwing
every decoy we have out there!

15:10.118 --> 15:12.870
We need to call in
every body that we can!

15:13.287 --> 15:14.747
How are the mods
on the amplifier?

15:15.164 --> 15:17.041
We're at 77 percent!

15:17.708 --> 15:18.918
That's not bad.

16:00.042 --> 16:01.294
Damn it!

16:02.545 --> 16:04.255
I'm gonna kill you!

16:07.717 --> 16:09.177
I'm...

16:09.677 --> 16:11.304
...gonna kill him!

16:12.096 --> 16:14.182
I'm gonna kill you!

16:16.142 --> 16:17.226
Grimmjow...

16:19.478 --> 16:20.771
Devour me.

16:22.940 --> 16:24.400
Devour me...

16:25.067 --> 16:26.652
and save Hueco Mundo.

16:40.499 --> 16:42.501
Ginjo, do you realize that

16:43.169 --> 16:45.963
you're fighting for
the Soul Reapers?

16:46.255 --> 16:47.256
It's not like that.

16:48.466 --> 16:49.967
When Ichigo comes back,

16:50.593 --> 16:53.054
it won't mean anything
if these guys aren't there.

16:53.971 --> 16:54.889
Hmm...

16:55.806 --> 16:57.808
We can leave it at that.

17:15.868 --> 17:17.036
Don't fight against it.

17:29.674 --> 17:31.425
Simply wait...

17:32.134 --> 17:33.761
for the hour.

17:58.703 --> 17:59.620
Now!

17:59.745 --> 18:00.746
Bankai!

18:02.248 --> 18:04.333
Jakuho Raikoben!!

18:07.420 --> 18:08.337
This time...

18:08.796 --> 18:10.756
I should be grateful for my Bankai.

18:16.887 --> 18:19.557
What is it that drives you all?

18:20.433 --> 18:21.601
That should be obvious.

18:35.531 --> 18:37.575
The weight we carry on our blades...

18:38.159 --> 18:39.201
is responsibility!

18:50.588 --> 18:52.173
I don't like it...

19:04.060 --> 19:07.021
Who the hell said
I'd follow your orders?

19:20.326 --> 19:23.829
I'm gonna bring it all down!

19:26.415 --> 19:27.541
You can't reach me.

19:28.542 --> 19:31.128
I saw it, Uryu.

19:46.644 --> 19:48.646
Hollows remaining: 74!

19:48.729 --> 19:51.065
Target lured
in front of the amplifier!

19:51.148 --> 19:53.526
Modifications at 100%.

19:53.609 --> 19:55.611
Target locked on Yhwach.

19:59.532 --> 20:00.616
We can do this!

20:00.908 --> 20:01.742
Fire!

20:13.879 --> 20:14.212
Output has dropped to 68%!

20:14.213 --> 20:15.046
68 PERCENT
Output has dropped to 68%!

20:15.047 --> 20:16.257
Output has dropped to 68%!

20:17.758 --> 20:18.967
WARNING

20:18.968 --> 20:20.135
WARNING
They're headed this way!

20:20.136 --> 20:20.261
WARNING

20:22.805 --> 20:24.932
WARNING

20:30.438 --> 20:31.480
Hey, what are you doing?!

20:32.022 --> 20:33.524
Ever since the past...

20:33.774 --> 20:36.318
...stuff like this isn't about logic.

20:45.369 --> 20:46.287
This is—!!

20:46.454 --> 20:47.371
Our...

20:59.842 --> 21:01.051
...pride!

21:07.808 --> 21:10.186
It's all meaningless.

21:15.816 --> 21:16.901
The time...

21:18.569 --> 21:19.904
has come...

22:15.751 --> 22:17.878
It's time for the end.

22:21.048 --> 22:24.510
The entire universe comprised
of all worlds will become one

22:25.928 --> 22:28.347
and will reveal itself here.

22:36.146 --> 22:37.022
What...

22:37.565 --> 22:38.482
...is this?

22:51.829 --> 22:53.122
<i>That bastard!</i>

22:53.497 --> 22:54.999
<i>What is he doing to me?</i>

22:55.207 --> 22:57.126
Petty Hollow!

23:02.715 --> 23:04.008
Got you!

23:06.302 --> 23:08.053
The Soul King's right arm?

23:08.137 --> 23:10.055
It's our right arm.

23:14.935 --> 23:18.272
This is the reason I survived!

23:21.525 --> 23:22.359
Now!

23:28.449 --> 23:32.369
So what if you halted my power
for a moment?!

23:32.953 --> 23:34.580
Now vanish...

23:34.914 --> 23:37.291
you along with your soul!

23:38.459 --> 23:40.002
Back at you!

23:42.922 --> 23:46.967
You're already out of moves,
Shunsui Kyoraku!

23:47.092 --> 23:49.053
Know what Kageoni is?

24:07.738 --> 24:08.656
<i>Go...</i>

24:08.989 --> 24:09.907
<i>Kurosaki!</i>

24:27.633 --> 24:29.134
<i>Zangetsu...</i>

24:30.177 --> 24:31.595
<i>Of course...</i>

24:32.721 --> 24:34.431
<i>So what I saw that time</i>

24:34.556 --> 24:37.893
<i>was the future seen with
my own eyes.</i>

24:39.520 --> 24:44.233
<i>I thought it was a dream
you made me see...</i>

24:45.442 --> 24:47.277
<i>Haschwalth.</i>

25:41.248 --> 25:42.415
<i>Retracing memories</i>

25:42.416 --> 25:46.170
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

25:46.253 --> 25:48.755
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

25:48.756 --> 25:50.882
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

25:50.883 --> 25:53.342
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

25:53.343 --> 25:56.013
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

25:56.096 --> 25:59.390
<i>All the voices shout</i>

25:59.391 --> 26:01.393
<i>The sound rang out</i>

26:16.950 --> 26:19.368
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

26:19.369 --> 26:21.705
<i>and I laughed</i>

26:21.872 --> 26:24.165
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

26:24.166 --> 26:26.460
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

26:26.543 --> 26:29.129
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

26:29.213 --> 26:31.757
<i>The end of the dream</i>

26:31.840 --> 26:36.302
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

26:36.303 --> 26:41.808
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

26:41.809 --> 26:43.060
<i>Break it</i>

26:43.227 --> 26:45.686
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

26:45.687 --> 26:48.689
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

26:48.690 --> 26:51.275
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

26:51.276 --> 26:53.529
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

26:53.612 --> 26:56.073
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

26:56.156 --> 26:58.826
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

26:58.909 --> 27:01.954
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

27:02.037 --> 27:05.623
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

27:05.624 --> 27:07.251
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR
